  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Rapidc 2000 Asia - Indien m&#xE4;tstat</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Rapidc 2000 Asien</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">RAPIDC-programmet &#xE4;r under beredning. F&#xF6;r att inte tappa tempo i arbetet i Male-l&#xE4;nderna i S&#xF6;dra Asien ges bidrag till insatser under 2000. Bl a f&#xF6;r att bilda en kommitte som f&#xF6;rbereder luftm&#xE4;tningar, st&#xF6;d till deltagande i f&#xF6;rsurningskonferens, m&#xE4;tningar i Indien samt st&#xF6;d till Stockholm Env Inst att utveckla programf&#xF6;rslag.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The RAPIDC program proposal is being developed by Stockholm Env Institute. In order not to loose momentum in the process in the Male- counties in South Asia, some funding is provided during 2000. A monitoring committee is established, participation in Acid Rain Conference, monitoring in India and SEI program development.</narrative>
  </description>
